---
/**
 * The three systems that protect a person's rights in Spain (CJD Bach, unit 2).
 *
 * Built to kill the single most common confusion: Strasbourg (Council of
 * Europe, ECHR) is not Luxembourg (EU, Charter), and neither is the UN.
 * Each ring names its treaty, its organ, what you can actually obtain and
 * what it costs you to get there.
 */
